Nyall Dawson <nyall.dawson@gmail.com>	2026-03-19

    Follow up recent cache Vary response handling

    Instead of completely skipping the cache for a new request
    where the previously cached response was for a non-matching
    Vary attribute, now we force evict the old reply from the
    cache.

    The previous behavior meant that only the FIRST value for
    the varied attribute would ever be cached. Now we always
    cache the MOST RECENTLY requested value for the varied
    attribute.

