Jean Felder <jean.felder@oslandia.com>	2026-02-26

    qgsprofilerenderer: Fix subsection indicator in image and pdf export

    `QgsProfilePlotRenderer::renderSubsectionsIndicator` is only called by
    `QgsProfilePlotRenderer::renderToImage`. This means that the
    subsections indicator are correctly rendered in the canvas, but they
    are not rendered on export because only
    `QgsProfilePlotRenderer::render` is called.

    This issue is fixed by directly calling
    `QgsProfilePlotRenderer::renderSubsectionsIndicator` in
    `QgsProfilePlotRenderer::render`.

