    Adjust geometry conversion from ESRI rest to explicitly allow curves or not

    The actual JSON objects don't explicitly state if a geometry is curved
    type or not so we were previously always returning the curved
    geometry types.

    This can break feature updates though, because if the service doesn't
    support curved geometries then we need to make sure the feature's
    geometry is a straight geometry.

