Nyall Dawson <nyall.dawson@gmail.com>	2026-02-26

    [browser] Fix refreshing ArcGIS REST services just uses cached response

    This fix follows the same behavior as the WMS provider implements -
    the initial population of the connection's children MAY use
    cached responses, but as soon as the user manually triggers a
    refresh on the connection item, the population will force
    a network retrieval ignoring any local cached response.

    Fixes #63010

    (cherry picked from commit e947adc79cb1fdd09cfcd93fdf7a528e306fb4a6)

