Jean Felder <jean.felder@oslandia.com>	2025-12-10

    qgsrubberband3d: Properly handle entities memory management

    `mPolygonEntity`, `mLineEntity`, `mMarkerEntity` already have their
    own parent. This means that they are already deleted when their parent
    is deleted. Therefore, one cannot directly delete these
    entities in the rubberband destructor. Otherwise, one end up with a
    double delete.

    This issue is fixed by QObjectUniquePtr. This ensures proper memory management.

Loïc Bartoletti <loic.bartoletti@oslandia.com>	2025-12-11

    fix(VectorLayerEditUtils): prevent Add Part tool from reversing LineString vertices

    The orientation check introduced in PR #55306 for OGC polygon ring
    ordering was incorrectly applied to all geometry types. For LineStrings,
    polygonOrientation() returns NoOrientation, causing the condition to
    always be true and systematically reversing added line parts.

    Fixes #64265

