Nyall Dawson <nyall.dawson@gmail.com>	2025-11-10

    When rendering text-on-line annotations, don't truncate text

    Instead extend the final portion of the line to fit the whole text

    Aside from being a more user-friendly behavior, this also avoids
    issues where final characters in a string may unpredictably
    show or hide depending on the map scale, if they only JUST fit
    with the line length.

