    [postgres] Add connection setting for restricting schema

    Like the equivalent Oracle provider setting, this allows users
    to specify a single schema to limit a Postgres connection to.

    When set, only tables from the matching schema will be included
    in the browser panel and data source select for the connection.

    This can be used to limit the database work required to populate
    tables for a connection pointing to a large database store.

    Sponsored by Regiodata

