    Escape HTML characters when showing in app message log

    When a message is logged which contains HTML characters, we
    need to treat this as a plain text message in the application
    message log and NOT as a HTML formatted message. The same
    logging calls are also used to write content to text outputs
    like the console and server log files, so we need to consistently
    treat logged messages as literal strings everywhere.

    Fixes #45834

