Even Rouault <even.rouault@spatialys.com>	2024-09-13

    Vector file metadata: drop BNA driver

    This driver was removed in GDAL 3.3. Most recent QGIS builds are
    presumably done against newer GDAL versions, so this is effectively dead
    code in practice. At worse QGIS 3.40+ won't just support this obscure
    BNA driver that nobody has probably ever used, even if the underlying
    GDAL still does.

